        "slc_6d4b0a341b2445ff4230ec443476631724a7f1ad0f885fe8890f102d7e3f1a3d"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI is launched as `devx`, supports starting in PLAN mode via `--plan`, and offers a headless one-shot mode using `-p \"<prompt>\"` with an optional `--yolo` flag."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f80693ebb1d80b677fa015b376cda64483823569f1efe7660f225169f263e9df",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db",
          "git_sha": "c6f96cb5f6a743e5305814a896a35834a9dea327",
          "line_end": 161,
          "line_start": 134,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "apvcode/termux-dev",
          "url": "https://github.com/apvcode/Termux-Dev/blob/a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db/README.md#L134-L161"
        },
        {
          "commit": "a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db",
          "git_sha": "c6f96cb5f6a743e5305814a896a35834a9dea327",
          "line_end": 132,
          "line_start": 132,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "apvcode/termux-dev",
          "url": "https://github.com/apvcode/Termux-Dev/blob/a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db/README.md#L132-L132"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_04fc3f3aa807a4911cc4abc2e23558628cdc5d16c2905e2a5552b3fc8459b82d",
        "slc_da282a06f762aafa7cc17270238a37e7042d3571dda20a2ea4407cb1957ed44a"
      ],
      "text": "A slash-command palette (opened by typing `/`) includes commands such as /plan, /agent, /mcp, /usage, /export, /theme, /doctor, /image, /serve, /memory, /undo, /diff, /commit, /status, /session, /resume, /settings, and /update."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b0a51910994376a3d6e37d3266297c88f66c516546ba8368a9bb35a09d10b6c6",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db",
          "git_sha": "c6f96cb5f6a743e5305814a896a35834a9dea327",
          "line_end": 171,
          "line_start": 167,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "apvcode/termux-dev",
          "url": "https://github.com/apvcode/Termux-Dev/blob/a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db/README.md#L167-L171"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_aad9c124c25e074efc0bacc7cffba75594a29f86baec7e0a59e19a1a18e87f48"
      ],
      "text": "Keybindings include Tab to toggle PLAN/AGENT modes, Ctrl+P/Ctrl+V for clipboard image paste, @filename fuzzy file autocomplete, atomic Backspace deletion of paste badges, and Ctrl+C to stop generation."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5d5833651bae0f0f3ebdd684332aa980e91c81acf0b03e03b51186cc6863281a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db",
          "git_sha": "c6f96cb5f6a743e5305814a896a35834a9dea327",
          "line_end": 54,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "apvcode/termux-dev",
          "url": "https://github.com/apvcode/Termux-Dev/blob/a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db/README.md#L31-L54"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_36512440500fb476e9c9d3277e55739f04e94fdbd76547d310d080a01758b203"
      ],
      "text": "The agent uses a dual-mode architecture: PLAN mode acts as a safe architect with a requirements questionnaire and no code edits, while AGENT mode autonomously edits files, runs terminal commands, and installs packages."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_e3272f4eb8f05a68c35ab36bf91c86ab002ab2e9f1eeeee7397220358b1b82c4",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db",
          "git_sha": "c6f96cb5f6a743e5305814a896a35834a9dea327",
          "line_end": 54,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "apvcode/termux-dev",
          "url": "https://github.com/apvcode/Termux-Dev/blob/a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db/README.md#L31-L54"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_36512440500fb476e9c9d3277e55739f04e94fdbd76547d310d080a01758b203"
      ],
      "text": "Finalized architectural plans are approved via a one-click `[Go / Other]` prompt, after which the coder agent begins implementation."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_674c4aac145bb50f5c1325440e0ee220aa249d1587f432ddee19e51c7548306a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db",
          "git_sha": "c6f96cb5f6a743e5305814a896a35834a9dea327",
          "line_end": 54,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "apvcode/termux-dev",
          "url": "https://github.com/apvcode/Termux-Dev/blob/a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db/README.md#L31-L54"
