          "url": "https://github.com/apvcode/Termux-Dev/blob/a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db/README.md#L31-L54"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_36512440500fb476e9c9d3277e55739f04e94fdbd76547d310d080a01758b203"
      ],
      "text": "The product includes a built-in local HTTP server (/serve, default port 3000) for previewing web apps and HTML5 games, opening on Android via termux-open-url."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6abe701bd4b366c95fa7b82e291c5778daadd43f75085935a18e62574d442693",
