          "line_end": 54,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "apvcode/termux-dev",
          "url": "https://github.com/apvcode/Termux-Dev/blob/a87cf5f6433248e360a4fe3ad822d8fb55fef1db/README.md#L31-L54"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_36512440500fb476e9c9d3277e55739f04e94fdbd76547d310d080a01758b203"
      ],
      "text": "Self-healing diagnostics run external checkers for TypeScript (tsc), JavaScript (node --check), Python (py_compile), and Rust (cargo check), with the AI fixing errors before finishing a turn."
    },
